   23e2   0a                LDN 10              ; D = from square
   23e3   bd                PHI 13              ; R13.1 = from
   23e4   1a                INC 10
   23e5   0a                LDN 10              ; D = to square
   23e6   ad                PLO 13              ; R13.0 = to
